oletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9cee6c38-300x162.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9cee6c38.jpg 740w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 418px) 100vw, 418px\" \/>Pro rutinn\u00ed aplikace rovn\u011b\u017e dod\u00e1v\u00e1me autosamplery a velk\u00e9 mno\u017estv\u00ed inteligentn\u00edho m\u011b\u0159ic\u00edho p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed a dedikovan\u00fd software v\u010detn\u011b automatizovan\u00fdch postup\u016f. Budete tak m\u00edt pod kontrolou cel\u00fd proces v\u00fdroby od kvality vstupn\u00edch surovin a\u017e po ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed parametr\u016f kone\u010dn\u00fdch produkt\u016f. P\u0159\u00edklady aplikac\u00ed molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie v pr\u016fmyslu:<\/p><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/veda-vyzkum-skolstvi\/uhlikove-nanoaplikace\/\">Uhl\u00edkov\u00e9 nanoaplikace<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/charakterizace-amorfniho-a-krystalickeho-kremiku\/\">Charakterizace amorfn\u00edho a krystalick\u00e9ho k\u0159em\u00edku<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/farmacie-a-medicina\/stanoveni-koncentrace-ozonu\/\">Stanoven\u00ed koncentrace ozonu<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/cz\/en\/home\/industrial\/spectroscopy-elemental-isotope-analysis\/spectroscopy-elemental-isotope-analysis-applications\/analytical-instrument-solutions-automotive\/automotive-fluids-lubricants\/affirma-service-lubricant-analysis-system-guide.html?icid=MSD_SPEC_MOL_PP_POD_IQLAADGAAGFAQVMBKA_6845_0918\">Anal\u00fdza opot\u0159eben\u00ed olej\u016f<\/a> (ASTM D2668, D7412, D7414, D7415, D7418, D7624, E2412; JOAP; DIN 51452, DIN 51453 atd.)<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/klasifikace-polyetylenu-pomoci-ramanovy-spektroskopie\/\">Klasifikace polyetylenu pomoc\u00ed Ramanovy spektroskopie<\/a><\/li><li>QA\/QC olej\u016f a maziv<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/farmacie-a-medicina\/kontrola-kvality-desinfekcnich-pripravku-behem-vyroby\/\">Kontrola kvality desinfek\u010dn\u00edch p\u0159\u00edpravk\u016f b\u011bhem v\u00fdroby<\/a><\/li><li>Sledov\u00e1n\u00ed oxidace \u0159epkov\u00e9ho oleje<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/vytvrzovani-akrylatu-kombinace-ft-ir-spektroskopie-a-reologie\/\">Vytvrzov\u00e1n\u00ed akryl\u00e1t\u016f: kombinace FT-IR spektroskopie a reologie<\/a><\/li><li>Kontrola v\u00fdroby bioethanolu<\/li><li>Kvantifikace ropn\u00fdch l\u00e1tek ve vod\u00e1ch a p\u016fd\u00e1ch<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/regenerace-rozpoustedel\/\">Regenerace rozpou\u0161t\u011bdel<\/a><\/li><li>Anal\u00fdza hlavn\u00edch parametr\u016f benz\u00edn\u016f a nafty<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/potravinarstvi-zemedelstvi-a-krmiva\/kontrola-obalu\/\">Kontrola a anal\u00fdza obal\u016f<\/a><\/li><li>Anal\u00fdza polymer\u016f: <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/analyza-polymeru\/\">Polymer kit<\/a> = n\u00e1vody, knihovny, rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 vzorkovac\u00ed p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed atd.<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/ftalaty\/\">Kvantitativn\u00ed anal\u00fdza obsahu ftal\u00e1t\u016f<\/a><\/li><li>Anal\u00fdza uhl\u00edkov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/medicinalni-plyny\/\">Kontrola slo\u017een\u00ed a \u010distoty (nejen) medicin\u00e1ln\u00edch plyn\u016f<\/a><\/li><li>Rychl\u00e1 kontrola \u010distoty provoz\u016f<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/plastova-soucastka\/\">Detektivka: Pro\u010d plastov\u00e1 sou\u010d\u00e1stka selhala?<\/a><\/li><li>A mnoh\u00e9 dal\u0161\u00ed<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-124ee62 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"124ee62\" data-element_type=\"